# Grimyapper — environment variables
#
# There are no required variables and no secrets. The court runs entirely
# in-process: a classifier trained by `npm run train`, a rubric model, and a
# composed decree corpus. Nothing is called, so there is nothing to configure.
#
# The optional knobs below only tune abuse limits. Copy to .env.local to change
# them; leave the file out entirely and the defaults apply.

# Per-IP sliding window on /api/judge.
# RATE_LIMIT_MAX=8
# RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000

# Hard ceiling on judgements per UTC day, per server instance.
# DAILY_JUDGEMENT_CAP=1500
